<title>USA: Cyrix vice president of finance resigns.</title>
<headline>Cyrix vice president of finance resigns.</headline>
<dateline>RICHARDSON, Texas 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyrix Corp on Friday said Tim Kinnear, its vice president of finance, resigned to accept a position as the chief financial officer of another company.</p>
<p>Company spokeswoman Ashley Goolsby declined to say which company Kinnear plans to join and also declined to say when his resignation becomes effective.</p>
<p>Cyrix, founded in 1988, supplies high-performance processors and systems to the personal computer industry.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
